    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/321d13c0d0b63bb29fbd77b3a68a288d.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/321d13c0d0b63bb29fbd77b3a68a288d.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/321d13c0d0b63bb29fbd77b3a68a288d.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/b229573ed531ac260e7dbeefac282de8.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div>Particle Hearts is a 3rd-person adventure game where you explore a world made entirely of particles.  Use special abilities to manipulate those particles, solve puzzles, avoid detection, and navigate this sinister and beautiful land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/3a156dd04b60b8e014a2acbb77bd30e6.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/3a156dd04b60b8e014a2acbb77bd30e6.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/3a156dd04b60b8e014a2acbb77bd30e6.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/4c083c9558a75826a08ef2860dd1781f.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div>Along the way, meet various creatures, some of which will help you understand your purpose and others who are tasked with hiding it from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/6516136d8ab940859e207d7d301d90c2.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/6516136d8ab940859e207d7d301d90c2.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/6516136d8ab940859e207d7d301d90c2.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/fe37e89d919df7039d7b27abb54d3c37.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div>Collect memories, find hidden paths, and piece together your connection to this land that isn\u2019t always what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0c049b5ef4e971181e6ce2d30673e8a5.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0c049b5ef4e971181e6ce2d30673e8a5.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0c049b5ef4e971181e6ce2d30673e8a5.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/c6272caeecaa8edc69e2e59f475bd229.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Gain multiple abilities that allow you to manipulate the particles around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Use your abilities to solve puzzles, evade enemies, and gain access to hidden areas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Freely explore open environments any way you\u2019d like.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Experience a story where the line between friend and foe is often blurred.  Meet various creatures that help you unravel your purpose in this land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0637530325a75a512a5cccf3d43187b8.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0637530325a75a512a5cccf3d43187b8.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0637530325a75a512a5cccf3d43187b8.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/f81cab0a87a83417d176c6372a8f50ee.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/321d13c0d0b63bb29fbd77b3a68a288d.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/321d13c0d0b63bb29fbd77b3a68a288d.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/321d13c0d0b63bb29fbd77b3a68a288d.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/b229573ed531ac260e7dbeefac282de8.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div>Particle Hearts is a 3rd-person adventure game where you explore a world made entirely of particles.  Use special abilities to manipulate those particles, solve puzzles, avoid detection, and navigate this sinister and beautiful land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/3a156dd04b60b8e014a2acbb77bd30e6.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/3a156dd04b60b8e014a2acbb77bd30e6.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/3a156dd04b60b8e014a2acbb77bd30e6.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/4c083c9558a75826a08ef2860dd1781f.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div>Along the way, meet various creatures, some of which will help you understand your purpose and others who are tasked with hiding it from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/6516136d8ab940859e207d7d301d90c2.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/6516136d8ab940859e207d7d301d90c2.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/6516136d8ab940859e207d7d301d90c2.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/fe37e89d919df7039d7b27abb54d3c37.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div>Collect memories, find hidden paths, and piece together your connection to this land that isn\u2019t always what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0c049b5ef4e971181e6ce2d30673e8a5.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0c049b5ef4e971181e6ce2d30673e8a5.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0c049b5ef4e971181e6ce2d30673e8a5.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/c6272caeecaa8edc69e2e59f475bd229.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Gain multiple abilities that allow you to manipulate the particles around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Use your abilities to solve puzzles, evade enemies, and gain access to hidden areas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Freely explore open environments any way you\u2019d like.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Experience a story where the line between friend and foe is often blurred.  Meet various creatures that help you unravel your purpose in this land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0637530325a75a512a5cccf3d43187b8.poster.avif?t=1752843745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0637530325a75a512a5cccf3d43187b8.webm?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/0637530325a75a512a5cccf3d43187b8.mp4?t=1752843745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/f81cab0a87a83417d176c6372a8f50ee.avif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p>",
